WEBVTT

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:21.420
I keep searching for my past

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:27.870
I wander through the unknown town

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.860
In the smell of flames

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:31.880
Bye.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.590
Gilgamesh and Baralant.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:46.700
These two constellations have been fighting for more than 100 years.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:54.020
At first, the war continued, but by the time I died, the war had expanded...

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:59.760
and more than 200 planets belonging to these two constellations were involved in the war.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:04.820
I fought.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:10.680
At first, I fought for the sake of Melkia, my hometown.

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:17.160
The fight was just going on, and there was no end to it.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.440
I was tired.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:23.170
Everyone was tired.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.620
Do you hear me? It's me, Karmegi.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.310
Yes, General, this is Kina.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.060
Have you settled the peace negotiations?

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:55.890
Idiot!

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.520
Do you think this war will end so easily?

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.000
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.320
There was a rumor about it.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.680
I heard you have a request from Captain Battentine.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:06.830
Let's go.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.290
Captain Battentine?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.320
Which one?

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:11.090
You know Captain Teltine, don't you?

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:11.740
Yes.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:13.710
He's a member of Planet Velobos.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.630
Who is he to you?

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.120
I want you to track him down right away.

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.630
By the way, Teltine is a large ship that has already finished its mission.

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.810
What's so important about it?

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:24.560
What's important is not the ship, but its destination.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:28.160
According to the beacon, the ship is heading for LX204.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.730
At last you've noticed.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:36.220
When they arrive, the job will be a pain in the ass.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:39.090
Everyone, get ready.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:40.660
We've arrived at the destination.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:09.990
- Are you sure? - Yes, I am.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:15.450
- I'll check the rest of them. - Make sure you check the mission desk.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:20.550
- I don't have anything in particular. - Where are they?

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:25.160
- Kiriko? - He's the one who was suddenly transferred from the previous unit.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.400
I brought him here because I didn't want to be suspected.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.000
I haven't told him anything. I'll leave it to you.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:32.920
- I'll do my best. - I'll do my best. Don't worry.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.880
All right. Let's go.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.260
Wait! Captain, isn't the enemy an ally?

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:43.800
I'll talk to you later.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.600
The two of you are going to be separated from now on.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:05.410
From No. 6 to me, and from here on out to the rest of you!

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:42.390
It's a trap!

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.310
Please tell me the reason!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:35.360
Can't you hear me?

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.210
But...

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.030
Don't move!

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:39.430
It's an order!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.860
Captain!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.260
Yes, sir!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.600
Oh!

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:05.600
Ah!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.600
Oh no!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.740
Ah!

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:17.620
Ah!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.620
It's not going to be easy.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.570
Captain, tell me your plan.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.810
Kiriko, if you don't stop, it's a military meeting.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:25.820
Captain!

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.800
Everyone, make a plan to wear it.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.040
It's noisy.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:29.890
Captain!

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:30.800
Master.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.640
What?

00:11:46.960 --> 00:11:47.440
What?

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.530
Find out if you can spot a wooden gun.

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:35.870
I want to take it out from there.

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:45.370
Yes, sir.

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:47.470
I know what it is.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:54.640
Why would you hide it?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.970
It's supposed to be an anti-aircraft gun.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.800
This is not a good strategy.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:17.890
-Aah! -It's an enemy!

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:19.940
We're starting the attack!

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:18.620
I'm sorry to wake you up, but could you answer my question?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.590
Where is this place?

00:14:20.590 --> 00:14:22.170
I'll ask the question.

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.900
First, let me hear your name.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.320
Kiriko, Kiriko Kyuubi.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.790
What's your date of birth?

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:29.730
Gilgamesh.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:33.850
- July 7th, 2326. - Eighteen years old.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:41.950
- What's your rank? - Gilgamesh Seidah, 24th Melchior Division, 204th Air Force.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:46.530
- What were you doing there? - Participating in the operation.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.520
- Who was it? - I haven't heard.

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:54.120
- Who was commanding you? - Oriat, Conan, and others.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:57.940
- Who was the one who destroyed the small planet Lido? - I don't know.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.000
- Then where did you send your body? - My body?

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.660
What do you mean?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:04.570
There was a box that looked like a coffin.

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:06.190
That's it.

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:08.520
Did you see what was inside?

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:12.400
Inside?

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:13.670
I didn't.

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:14.700
Tell me a lie.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.120
Where did you find the body?

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.180
I don't know!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.820
I really don't know!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:19.800
Don't be stupid!

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.890
I was betrayed by my friends.

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:23.390
That's why, the rest is...

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:25.830
Ouch!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.790
- How is he? - He's fainted.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.250
It seems his shock is too strong.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:41.390
So it was the work of his allies.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.680
What do you think, Chinatai?

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:48.540
Your Excellency, this is the only clue we have.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.680
We have no choice but to expose him.

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:53.780
Even so, it's a serious situation.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:57.110
In this case, we should stop the rescue mission as soon as possible.

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.350
While we don't leak the secret to Alarant.

00:15:59.350 --> 00:15:59.860
Yes, sir.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:02.700
I'm going back to Melchia right away.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.930
Let's slowly cook this guy.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:29.510
Was Melchia badly killed?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.470
A third of the population has died.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.950
So it doesn't matter if one more person dies.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:30.000
I've been doing this for three hours, but it's surprisingly tough.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.490
Kiriko! Cut it out! Where is the body?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:36.310
I-I don't know! I don't know!

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:38.320
Increase the voltage.

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.680
No! This will cost me my life!

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:44.550
Mr. Fuusen, you don't seem to understand the importance of this matter.

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:45.910
- But... - Do it!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:18:00.000
- What's wrong? - My heart stopped!

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:03.260
Idiot! Get me out of here as soon as possible!

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:07.520
Not yet? I can't move yet.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.470
If he dies, you'll be in trouble too.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:40.190
I'll finish you off today.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:44.200
I don't think he really knows about it.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.830
No, he's a criminal.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:19:00.000
He must be hiding something.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.960
It seems to have stopped.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:03.920
It seems that even if it receives that torture for three days, it still won't heal.

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:06.260
It's a very stubborn guy.

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.160
That too, two or three days later.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.140
It seems that neither unit has failed.

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:24.770
It seems that it's not completely closed.

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:25.950
It's closed, isn't it?

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.390
Is it broken?

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.510
I'll take a look for a moment.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.620
That's strange.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.330
I don't see anything.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:18.420
- Who's responsible? - I am!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:24.520
- Close the shutters! - Yes, sir!

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:02.150
No, there's no need to rush.

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:09.290
According to the balloon army, there are already beacons in Kiriko's body.

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:14.280
Melkia All Area Monitoring Station, as well as the satellite monitoring system, activate!

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:39.620
That horrible war was over on that day.

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:42.090
But it had no meaning at all.

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.790
From the moment I saw it, my own battle had begun.

00:22:46.990 --> 00:22:49.570
An endless battle.

00:22:50.230 --> 00:23:00.000
Kiriko, who had escaped from Luchina, was waiting for me.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.200
was once again hell.

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:05.750
Desire and violence settled after destruction.

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:08.770
The city of Sodom, the birthplace of the Hundred Years' War.

00:23:08.770 --> 00:23:11.690
Devils, evil spirits, ruins, and chaos

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:14.090
are all thrown into the concrete mixer.

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:17.060
This is the planet Melchior's Gomorrah.

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:19.200
Next episode: Udo.

00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:22.790
Next week, Kiriko and I will go to hell.
